li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Quests (Fabric) (by FTB)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/durability-tooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\">Durability Tooltip (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yeetusexperimentus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yeetus Experimentus (by Sunekaer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectiblechains\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connectible Chains [Fabric] (by legoatoom)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/equipment-compare-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Equipment Compare [Fabric] (by Grend_G)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\">BCLib (by Quiqueck)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin (by modmuss50)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterstats\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Statistics Screen (by TheCSDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling Fabric/Forge (by tr7zw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/world-play-time\" rel=\"nofollow\">World Play Time (by khajiitos)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-real-magic-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snow! Real Magic! ⛄ (Fabric) (by Snownee)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Gui (by ezzenix1)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-end-crashed-ships-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd Crashed Ships Tweaks (by MuonR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermoo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermoo (by TheDeathlyCow)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">ПОЛЕЗНЫЕ КОМАНДЫ И ИНФОРМАЦИЯ</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>Отобразить сердца в табуляции как индикатор здоровья игрока: /scoreboard objectives add health health<br>/scoreboard objectives setdisplay list health</li>\n<li>Добавить счётчик смертей под никами игроков: /scoreboard objectives add Deaths deathCount<br>/scoreboard objectives setdisplay belowname deaths</li>\n<li>Удаление сердец с помощью: /ls withdraw</li>\n<li>Для работы OSC необходимо ввести \"/carpet optimized fast entity movement true\", если установлены Carpet и Carpet TIS Addition.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Пожалуйста, оставьте комментарий, если вы обнаружите какие-либо ошибки или проблемы, чтобы мы могли вместе улучшить этот пак!</strong></span></p>",
